# Golden G-M0-2: transport as clock master.
# Start emits FA + one immediate F8 (tick 0 of the transport is a clock
# tick); 80 ticks then carry two more F8 (every 40 ticks at 960 PPQN);
# stop emits FC and the clock goes silent.
port open out synth
clock out synth
transport start
advance 80
transport stop
advance 80
quit
